  10: // HISO-010: the harness CI bar runs every Vitest invocation (its own unit and
  11: // coverage gates and the ones nested in `certify`) with CVG_TEST_SCOPE=core,
  12: // so consumer products under products/** never enter the harness test or
  13: // coverage denominators; each product is tested by its own workflow. Unset
  14: // keeps the aggregated transition regression of ADR-010 criterion 5, which
  15: // is also what the product's path-filtered `npm test --workspace` relies on.
  16: // PDSH-031: the per-file gate for the neutral core (contracts, harness,
  17: // orchestrator, agent-runtime). When enabled, every covered file of those
  18: // four packages must reach 100% statements/branches/functions/lines; every
  19: // other covered package keeps being measured by the aggregate thresholds.
  20: // `scripts/ci-bar*.mjs` (PDSH-033) runs the bar with this flag enabled.
  21: const perFileGate = process.env.CVG_COVERAGE_PER_FILE === '1'
  22: 
  23: const aggregateThresholds = {
  24:   statements: 90,
  25:   branches: 85,
  26:   functions: 90,
  27:   lines: 90
  28: }
